description = "MUTATION: Decisive Cut becomes 4 rapid hits in a wider arc (x2.0 width, about 2.2m); the final hit carries 55% of the damage and impact. Same total damage, longer commitment (+0.1s recovery): full damage needs the whole sequence to land. Excludes Precision Edge and Momentum Edge."
